    "预览会转换 Front Matter、Slug、图片目标路径和重定向候选，但不会复制文件或访问网络。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preview converts front matter, slugs, image target paths, and redirect candidates without copying files or accessing the network."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
