            "state": "translated",
            "value": "预览会转换 Front Matter、Slug、图片目标路径和重定向候选，但不会复制文件或访问网络。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "首次推送会提交生成的 Starter 文件，并推送到 origin 的目标分支。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first push commits the generated starter files and pushes them to the target branch on origin."
          }
        },
