            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次推送会提交生成的 Starter 文件，并推送到 origin 的目标分支。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "首次推送后，到 GitHub 仓库的 Pages / Actions 确认构建状态。后续文章发布会在发布记录里持续追踪部署。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After the first push, check the build status in Pages / Actions on GitHub. Future article deployments will be tracked in publishing history."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次推送后，到 GitHub 仓库的 Pages / Actions 确认构建状态。后续文章发布会在发布记录里持续追踪部署。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "高级调试用：启动本地 HTTP 接收器或粘贴平台 Webhook JSON，写入最新发布记录的部署快照和历史。普通发布建议使用手动检查或部署轮询。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For advanced debugging: start the local HTTP receiver or paste platform webhook JSON to add deployment snapshots and history to the latest publishing record. For normal publishing, use manual checks or deployment polling."
          }
        },
